    {
     "role": "running-head",
     "text": "PUBLIC LAW 107–94—DEC. 21, 2001          115 STAT. 901"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "(15) by striking \"$3,553\" each place it appears in sub-"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "sections (o) and (p) and inserting \"$3,775\";"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "(16) by striking \"$1,525\" and \"$2,271\" in subsection (r)"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "and inserting \"$1,621\" and \"$2,413\", respectively; and"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "(17) by striking \"$2,280\" in subsection (s) and inserting"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "\"$2,422\"."
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "38 USC 1114"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "note."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "(b) SPECIAL RULE.—The Secretary of Veterans Affairs may"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "authorize administratively, consistent with the increases authorized"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "by this section, the rates of disability compensation payable to"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "persons within the purview of section 10 of Public Law 85–857"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "who are not in receipt of compensation payable pursuant to chapter"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "11 of title 38, United States Code."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "SEC. 3. ADDITIONAL COMPENSATION FOR DEPENDENTS."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "Section 1115(1) is amended—"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "(1) by striking \"$117\" in clause (A) and inserting \"$124\";"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "(2) by striking \"$201\" and \"$61\" in clause (B) and inserting"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "\"$213\" and \"$64\", respectively;"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "(3) by striking \"$80\" and \"$61\" in clause (C) and inserting"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "\"$84\" and \"$64\", respectively;"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "(4) by striking \"$95\" in clause (D) and inserting \"$100\";"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "(5) by striking \"$222\" in clause (E) and inserting \"$234\";"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "and"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "(6) by striking \"$186\" in clause (F) and inserting \"$196\"."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "SEC. 4. CLOTHING ALLOWANCE FOR CERTAIN DISABLED VETERANS."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "Section 1162 is amended by striking \"$546\" and inserting"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "\"$580\"."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "SEC. 5. DEPENDENCY AND INDEMNITY COMPENSATION FOR SUR-"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "VIVING SPOUSES."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "(a) NEW LAW RATES.—Section 1311(a) is amended—"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "(1) by striking \"$881\" in paragraph (1) and inserting \"$935\";"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "and"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "(2) by striking \"$191\" in paragraph (2) and inserting \"$202\"."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "(b) OLD LAW RATES.—The table in section 1311(a)(3) is amended"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "to read as follows:"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "Monthly                                        Monthly"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "\"Pay grade                                    rate  Pay grade                                    rate"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "E–1 ................................    $935     W–4 ................................  $1,119"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "E–2 ................................      935     O–1 ................................      988"
    },
