     "text": "W–2 ................................   1,028     O–10 ................................  1,994 2"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "W–3 ................................   1,058"
    },
    {
     "role": "footnote",
     "text": "\"1If the veteran served as Sergeant Major of the Army, Senior Enlisted Advisor of"
    },
    {
     "role": "footnote",
     "text": "the Navy, Chief Master Sergeant of the Air Force, Sergeant Major of the Marine"
    },
    {
     "role": "footnote",
     "text": "Corps, or Master Chief Petty Officer of the Coast Guard, at the applicable time des-"
    },
    {
     "role": "footnote",
     "text": "ignated by section 1302 of this title, the surviving spouse's rate shall be $1,149."
    },
    {
     "role": "footnote",
     "text": "\"2If the veteran served as Chairman or Vice Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff,"
    },
